abstract: "A Field Guide to Deploying AI Systems That Survive the Enterprise. A demo is L0. Delivery is L4. Enterprise AI dies in the last mile, not in the model. 27 chapters, 24 field templates, and 22 zero-dependency scripts, following one delivery cycle from a vague one-line ask to the day you step out of the daily."
